# Ignore all hidden files
.*

# MindStone local deployment (mindstone/): its .env holds the Console's secrets, the gateway
# token and the admin credential, and data-node/uploads/logs hold live data. Compose mounts
# what the container needs at runtime, so none of it may be baked into the image.
mindstone
**/.env*
